    notes: JCM265 adds three printed salts to JCM151 trace minerals. Preserve unresolved
      x hydration in MnSO4 and unqualified AlK(SO4)2; unquantified KOH pH adjustment
      retained. All three source occurrences explicitly reference265; no global Wolfe-name
      equivalence. JCM265 explicitly adds0.02g NiCl2·6H2O,0.001g Na2SeO3 and0.01g
      Na2WO4·2H2O to1.0L of prepared JCM151 trace minerals. The nested stock is an
      aliquot; its complete source batch made with1L added water is not flattened
      into the aliquot. JCM151 literal formula and competing existing owners are retained
      in primary evidence and ownership-conflict artifact. Component identity is established
      as this source stock; catalog ownership is not guessed.
